{{is-decl-pron-einhver}}

====Derived terms====
* [[að einhverju leyti]] (in part)
* [[einhvern daginn]]
* [[einhvern tíma]]
* [[einhverju sinni]]
* [[einhvern veginn]]

====Usage notes====
* The neuter singular form {{term|eitthvert|lang=is}} is used [[demonstrative]]ly ({{term|hliðstæður|hliðstætt|lang=is}}), i.e. with a [[noun]] while the neuter singular form {{term|eitthvað|lang=is}} is used [[substantive]]ly ({{term|sérstæður|sérstætt|lang=is}}):
*: ''Heyrðirðu '''eitthvað'''?''
*:: Did you hear '''something'''?
*: ''[http://visindavefur.hi.is/svar.asp?id=3178 Er '''eitthvert''' sannleikskorn í grísku goðsögunum]?''
*:: Is there '''some''' grain of truth to the Greek myths?

